# Between-scene "Bread or Smoke" (OPEN branch), ~35 s (docs/design/script-episodes-4-8/e6m2.md, shot list G1-G4; beats
# from docs/design/mission-e6-02.md Cinematic hooks `c_e6_gate`). Present day, grey dawn at the Frostgate: Torvald,
# older, on the wall above the gate. This film is the OPEN branch (e6m2 opened the gate: a cloth-wrapped loaf on the
# parapet, "Hearthwick still sends me bread every midwinter. Burnt, usually.", Hearthwick's chimneys smoking far off);
# the SHUT branch is c_e6_gate_shut (the same film: no loaf, "Some nights I still see the smoke."). The narrator hands
# to Ysolde. Text source for i18n / voices: data/voice/lines/c_e6_gate.json (L1_open, L2).
# e6m2 / e6m3 are not built: not in CampaignState.STORY_FILMS yet; picking the branch by e6m2_town_saved needs a
# StoryFlow film-by-flag pick (not built). Play it with run_cine.ps1 play c_e6_gate.
# Set: forge_intro_torvald stands in for the Frostgate (e6m2's map is not a stage set): its ice keep's rampart and gate,
# its signal brazier; dawn = a grey-blue full-screen grade. Prop: the loaf = the red-cloth bundle of c_e4_turnback.
# Axis: every camera east of the road (the outline's 3/4-left on Torvald).
cine c_e6_gate  title="Bread or Smoke"  letterbox=2.39  seed=603  length=33..37
use set forge_intro_torvald
use music res://assets/audio/forge/music/ep4_opening.wav  vol=-24
cast  narrator  capsule  at=(0, 0, -300)  hidden=1  speaker=narrator
cast  loaf      res://art/cinematics/props/ep4_between/bundle_red.tscn  at=(5.6, 5.05, -3.5)  yaw=20

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the Frostgate at dawn
# Wide, the gate from the south road: its ice older and clouded, snow along the Long Ice
shot G1 8.0  cam=dolly  from=(3.0, 2.4, 19.0)  to=(2.6, 2.6, 16.0)  look=(1.0, 4.0, -8.0)  fov=46  in=fade_black:1.0
  at 0.0  fade color=#6a7f98  alpha=0.3  time=0.05
  at 0.0  hide colossus
  at 0.0  hide frostbow
  at 0.0  hide messenger
  at 0.0  hide foe
  at 0.0  hide army_line
  at 0.0  hide army_charge
  at 0.0  hide fx_icewall
  at 0.0  hide fx_burst
  at 0.0  hide fx_heart
  at 0.0  hide fx_cracks
  at 0.0  show fx_snow
  at 0.0  teleport torvald  to=(4.6, 5.0, -4.0)  yaw=10
  at 0.0  sfx res://assets/audio/forge/sfx/snow_step.wav  vol=-24
# MS Torvald on the wall above the gate, 3/4-left: snow on his shoulders, the loaf beside him
shot G2 8.0  cam=static  from=(7.0, 6.3, -0.4)  look=(4.7, 6.6, -4.0)  fov=36  faces=torvald
  at 0.0  anim torvald set_expression  arg=neutral
  at 1.0  line torvald "Hearthwick still sends me bread every midwinter. Burnt, usually."  dur=5.0
  at 4.0  anim torvald set_expression  arg=smile
# CU Torvald, front: he looks south down the road; far off, Hearthwick's chimneys smoking
shot G3 8.0  cam=static  from=(4.7, 6.75, -1.6)  look=torvald  fov=28
  at 3.0  vfx chimney  scene=res://art/cinematics/fx/fire_pillar.tscn  at=(-12, 0, 40)  life=5  scale=0.3
# Crane up off the wall and away west over the snow: the clouds turn to a green-gold dawn in the west
shot G4 11.0  cam=crane  from=(7.0, 7.0, 0.0)  to=(-14, 26, 12)  look=(4.6, 5.6, -4.0)>(-60, 10, 0)  fov=44>52
  at 2.0  line narrator "In the west, Ysolde remembered a different winter."  dur=3.8
  at 4.0  fade color=#d8f0b0  alpha=0.25  time=3.0
  at 10.0  fade color=#ffffff  alpha=1  time=1.0
